::  languages/glow/compiler/middle_passes.glow -- Assay & Pith
/-  compiler-shapes
/+  front-passes
/!  32768
|%
++  fold-assay-budget
  |=  [ticks=@ud step-bytes=@ud ceiling=@ud]            ::  loop & `/!` cap
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  proven arena sum
  ~|  'unbounded-loop-refused'                          ::  require >0 ticks
  ?>  (gte ticks 1)                                     ::  finite termination
  =/  needed=@ud  (mul ticks step-bytes)                ::  worst-case bytes
  ~|  'declared-frame-budget-exceeded'                  ::  check `/!` cap
  ?>  (lte needed ceiling)                              ::  fits Tally slice
  needed
++  fold-pith-op
  |=  op-code=@ud                                       ::  SSA Pith opcode
  ^-  @ud                                               ::  narrow-waist 1..16
  ?>  (lte op-code 16)                                  ::  <= 16 core ops
  op-code
--
